// TransferOwner hands one VM on a clustered ("brain-in-operator") provider's
// host to a VirtualMachine: it re-stamps the VM with that VirtualMachine's
// identity (owner), after which the provider's routed, owner-checked per-VM
// calls accept it (ADR-0007 Addendum A, slice 4). The adoption flow uses it
